    "name": "Holy Whore Emily",
    "steam_appid": 1528540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/e806da4c0372442dfe4c2f5d3dec35da.poster.avif?t=1750391273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/e806da4c0372442dfe4c2f5d3dec35da.webm?t=1750391273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/e806da4c0372442dfe4c2f5d3dec35da.mp4?t=1750391273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">18 years ago, Cardinal Gilbert was punished by the archbishop for committing a mistake in the capital's archdiocese. He was demoted to the remote seaside town of Kynaston, where he would succeed the deceased ex-bishop and govern for 20 years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time passed by quickly, and Kynaston became a prosperous commercial town. The daughter he had adopted from the orphanage here, Emily, also celebrated her 18th birthday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Without a &quot;Blessed Girl&quot;\u2014an agent appointed as the saint guardian by the goddess Aphro \u2014for a long time, the town would inevitably fall back into poverty and destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gilbert, who observed that Emily was no less qualified than any previous saints, decided to make her a saint. However, as she was not a blessed girl, she faced opposition from the believers. Thus, he made an agreement with everyone that if she could not be acknowledged within two years, she would step down from the position of saint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/bae978dc953deda3cb33ebc20fb77247.poster.avif?t=1750391273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/bae978dc953deda3cb33ebc20fb77247.webm?t=1750391273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/bae978dc953deda3cb33ebc20fb77247.mp4?t=1750391273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While Gilbert was guiding Emily to become a saint, an intruder appeared in the church! He was so elusive that he successfully escaped the church's pursuit again and again, giving Gilbert a headache. What was his purpose...!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two years were neither long nor short, and the time the two had to spend together was gradually running out. Would Emily be able to overcome the many difficulties and break the myth among believers that &quot;an unblessed girl could not be a saint?&quot; Would she realize her dream?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/8d7ac4d6a64809d1d9c11356d9bd1c95.poster.avif?t=1750391273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/8d7ac4d6a64809d1d9c11356d9bd1c95.webm?t=1750391273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/8d7ac4d6a64809d1d9c11356d9bd1c95.mp4?t=1750391273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Gameplay Instructions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every day is divided into three time periods. Players will take on the role of the bishop of Kynaston Town. Within two years, he should guide and train Emily to carry out various activities in the church or go out onto the streets to try various jobs and increase their income. Some actions will be unlocked as the plot develops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After accumulating enough funds, you can invest in the expansion of the church and give Emily a better learning environment, increasing her learning and working efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You should not neglect your interactions with Emily. Interact with her enough to maintain your relationship or bring her even closer to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The various values \u200b\u200baccumulated according to your actions will affect the final ending. Please confirm her study plan now and again, complete all tasks, and arrange the best future for her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/229de827fd7599d82f2f0378e5c76e47.poster.avif?t=1750391273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/229de827fd7599d82f2f0378e5c76e47.webm?t=1750391273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/229de827fd7599d82f2f0378e5c76e47.mp4?t=1750391273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7 30 basic CGs, including many differentials and 11 motion HCGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7 Game text: ca. 120,000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7One main female character\u2014sex with the protagonist and other people are included, but you can also complete the story with pure love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7 A simulation game with the goal of raising your daughter to be a saint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7 8 normal endings, 2 extra endings, and 2 bad endings during the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/f12c7ee261925e70113aefa03b999e7e.poster.avif?t=1750391273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/f12c7ee261925e70113aefa03b999e7e.webm?t=1750391273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/f12c7ee261925e70113aefa03b999e7e.mp4?t=1750391273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
