A simulation game with the goal of raising your daughter to be a saint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7 8 normal endings, 2 extra endings, and 2 bad endings during the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/f12c7ee261925e70113aefa03b999e7e.poster.avif?t=1750391273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/f12c7ee261925e70113aefa03b999e7e.webm?t=1750391273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528540/extras/f12c7ee261925e70113aefa03b999e7e.mp4?t=1750391273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
